{"id":"3997a1696a1be702","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism.md","title":"Theorem — locale 映射的层几何态射","display":"Theorem — locale 映射的层几何态射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism","aliases":["14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism"],"display":"Theorem — locale 映射的层几何态射","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]"],"source_location":"IX.5 Proposition 2, printed 488–489; DjVu 250","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — locale 映射的层几何态射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IX.5 Proposition 2, printed 488–489; DjVu 250"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的三参数签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)\">\\(h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a> 的框架同态；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a>。</li>\n<li>locale 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a> 编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,X,h)\">\\((Y,X,h)\\)</span>，其逆向框架分量记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}:=h\">\\(f^{-1}:=h\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Xa\">\\(y_Xa\\)</span> 是可表预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)\\)</span>，在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a> 的覆盖下已为层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Yb\">\\(y_Yb\\)</span> 同理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\widetilde f\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(\\widetilde f,\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathcal O(Y)\\ \\widetilde f^{\\,*}(y_Yb)\\cong y_X(h(b))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\widetilde f\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(\\widetilde f,\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathcal O(Y)\\ \\widetilde f^{\\,*}(y_Yb)\\cong y_X(h(b))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.5 Proposition 2，印刷 488–489，DjVu 250 的 locale–topos 对应；y_X(b) 是由开集 b 给出的次终可表层。框架同态保持有限交和覆盖上确界，故在开集站点上给连续左正合函子，诱导所述几何态射；逆像作用于开集次终对象为 h。原稿记载曾核对源存在定理，未机器构造左右像函子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}$ 采用 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的三参数签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)$ 为 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的框架同态；$\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)$ 采用 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)$ 为 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的框架同态；$\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)$ 采用 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"locale 映射 $f:X\\to Y$ 按 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 编码为 $(Y,X,h)$，其逆向框架分量记 $f^{-1}:=h$；$y_Xa$ 是可表预层 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)$，在 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]] 的覆盖下已为层，$y_Yb$ 同理。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"locale 映射 $f:X\\to Y$ 按 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 编码为 $(Y,X,h)$，其逆向框架分量记 $f^{-1}:=h$；$y_Xa$ 是可表预层 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)$，在 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]] 的覆盖下已为层，$y_Yb$ 同理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathcal O(Y)\\to\\mathcal O(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"(Y,X,h)","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}:=h","display":false},{"tex":"y_Xa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_X}(-,a)","display":false},{"tex":"y_Yb","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\widetilde f\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(\\widetilde f,\\mathbf{Sh}(X),\\mathbf{Sh}(Y))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathcal O(Y)\\ \\widetilde f^{\\,*}(y_Yb)\\cong y_X(h(b))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1742,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-map-geometric-morphism|Theorem — loca